The icon artwork in `assets/` is AROS's own.

The icons are the "Mason" icon set from the AROS repository
(https://github.com/aros-development-team/AROS, `images/IconSets/Mason`),
converted by `tools/icontool/convert.py` into the compact form this crate
reads. The artwork is distributed under the AROS project's own licence; see
the AROS repository's LICENSE file for the terms, and
https://www.aros.org/ for the project.

